            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "Keep Watching is a virtual reality horror game. The goal is simple. Escape. You'll need to keep watching though, they move when your back is turned.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use headphones for the best experience.</li><li>Search the map.</li><li>Find the Key.</li><li>Keep watching.</li><li>Use your flashlight, but be careful. The brighter the light, the faster the battery drains.</li><li>Use the camera to buy some time.</li><li>Escape.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Useful Information</h2>Currently the flashlight only works with the left controller and the camera only works with the right controller. Teleportation is also limited to the right controller right now. If you're a lefty, feel free to swap controllers on launch, but currently there's no in-game switching. Please keep this in mind if you're considering purchasing.<br><br>The current method of locomotion is teleportation. Touchpad walking is in the works, but may only be included if requested.",
